                                    <span class="lp-home__tab"><svg class="lp-home__ico lp-home__ico--payments" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="24" height="24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path fill="currentColor" d="M19 14V6c0-1.1-.9-2-2-2H3c-1.1 0-2 .9-2 2v8c0 1.1.9 2 2 2h14c1.1 0 2-.9 2-2zm-9-1c-1.66 0-3-1.34-3-3s1.34-3 3-3 3 1.34 3 3-1.34 3-3 3zm13-6v11c0 1.1-.9 2-2 2H4v-2h17V7h2z"/></svg><span>Payments</span></span>
                                    <span class="lp-home__tab"><svg class="lp-home__ico lp-home__ico--menu" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="24" height="24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path fill="currentColor" d="M3 18h18v-2H3v2zm0-5h18v-2H3v2zm0-7v2h18V6H3z"/></svg><span>More</span></span>
